Modifications by Arkmusn, 2026:
- Renamed the product from "Paseo Cafe" to "Plugin market" and changed the
  plugin id from "paseo-cafe" to "paseo-market".
- Replaced the single-registry model with multiple market sources: the official
  Paseo registry, the Paseo Cafe directory, and user-added custom JSON sources
  that auto-detect either shape.
- Added an "Installed plugins" screen with enable, disable, reload, update and
  uninstall actions, backed by new directory RPCs.
- Rewrote the Settings screen as a source manager (add, enable, remove, restore
  defaults, run updates now) and bumped the settings schema to version 6 with a
  migration from the previous registryUrl field.
- Changed the directory browse UI to a multi-source list with per-source
  filtering and per-source failure reporting.